Package: glyfp
Title: Structural Fingerprints for Glycans
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Bin", "Fu", , "23110220018@m.fudan.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8567-2997"))
Description: Encodes glycan structures as binary or count vectors of connected
    residue substructures. Learns explicit feature dictionaries and reuses them
    across batches, preserving residue identities, substituents, and glycosidic
    linkage labels from 'glyrepr' structures. Optionally computes pretrained
    'SweetNet' embeddings with a separately configured Python CPU environment
    and verified local model weights.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    cli,
    glyrepr (>= 1.2.0),
    glymotif (>= 1.0.0),
    glyparse (>= 0.8.1),
    igraph,
    rlang
Suggests:
